      "content": "thanks... i guess i can try that. but 400mg still feels like a risky amount if i'm already on a blood thinner. my neighbor said that if i get any stomach pains or if my poop looks really dark like coffee grounds i should go to the er right away. how serious is that actually? is it really an emergency or is it usually just a sign of indigestion from the Advil?",
