      "content": "okay, that makes sense. i'll be careful. but since i'm trying to avoid the hospital if i can, what's the absolute maximum amount of advil i can take at once if the pain is really bad? like if i take a higher dose, can i just take something else to balance it out so i don't get those bleeding issues?",
